  "supportFaqCancelQ": "Can I cancel a booking?",
  "supportFaqChauffeursA": "Before receiving rides, we review and approve their license, ID card, criminal record certificate, SOAT insurance and vehicle registration. If a document expires, they stop receiving rides until it's renewed.",
  "supportFaqChauffeursQ": "How are chauffeurs verified?",
  "supportFaqCorporateA": "Your company's admin adds you with your e-mail. When booking you choose \"Bill to company\", with a cost center and reference if needed. The company gets a monthly statement.",
  "supportFaqCorporateQ": "How does the corporate account work?",
  "supportFaqLostA": "Open the trip's receipt, tap \"Help with this trip\" and choose \"Lost item\". We'll contact the chauffeur and arrange the return with you.",
  "supportFaqLostQ": "I left something in the car",
  "supportFaqPayA": "The price in bolivianos is fixed when you book. You pay the chauffeur at the end of the trip, in cash or by QR. If your company has a corporate account, the ride goes on its monthly invoice and you pay nothing.",
  "supportFaqPayQ": "How do I pay?",
